  "oldText": "rw [linearIndependent_fin2]",
  "message":
  "this parameter is redundant, environment already contains `map_mul` annotated with `@[grind =]`this parameter is redundant, environment already contains `map_inv` annotated with `@[grind =]`Try these:\n  [apply] grind only [!Projectivization.linearIndependent_pair_iff_ne]\n  [apply] grind => instantiate only [!Projectivization.linearIndependent_pair_iff_ne]",
